e issuance information; common DV certificates only verify domain name control rights, and automatic issuance also needs to be configured correctly"},{"key":"tunnel","cn":"加密通道","en":"Encryption","desc":"TLS 用加密和完整性校验保护传输；终端设备或网站本身仍可能有风险","desc_en":"TLS protects transmissions with encryption and integrity checks; the end device or website itself may still be at risk"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"DV 证书","en":"Domain Validated","demo":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">🔒 <span style=\"font-family:monospace\">vibeui.dev</span> <span class=\"demo-tag green\">DV</span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">🔒 <span style=\"font-family:monospace\">vibeui.dev</span> <span class=\"demo-tag green\">DV</span></span>","when":"只验证域名，托管平台免费自动签","when_en":"Only verify the domain name, the hosting platform will automatically sign it for free"},{"cn":"OV / EV 证书","en":"Organization Validated","demo":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">🔒 <span style=\"font-family:monospace\">bank.example</span> <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">OV</span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\">🔒 <span style=\"font-family:monospace\">bank.example</span> <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">OV</span></span>","when":"额外验证企业身份，银行政务常用","when_en":"Additional verification of corporate identity, commonly used in banking and government affairs"}],"use":[{"t":"上线<b>默认开 HTTPS</b>：许多托管平台可自动申请和续期证书，仍要检查域名绑定、续期状态与重定向","m":"https-auto"},{"t":"小锁表示<b>到该域名的连接受 TLS 保护</b>；它不评价网站内容、经营者或交易安全","m":"https-lock"},{"t":"页面是 https，里面的<b>图片、脚本也要 https</b> 引入","m":"https-resource"},{"t":"涉及<b>登录、支付</b>的页面，https 是底线","m":"https-login"}],"dont":[{"t":"公开网站仍使用 <b>HTTP</b>：传输未受 TLS 保护，浏览器也可能显示不安全提示","m":"https-notsecure","bad":true},{"t":"https 页面里引 <b>http 资源</b>：浏览器会拦截许多主动混合内容，其他资源也可能被升级或警告；应统一使用 HTTPS","m":"https-mixed","bad":true},{"t":"<b>证书过期未续期</b>：浏览器会显示警告，并可能阻止用户继续访问","m":"https-expired","bad":true},{"t":"看到「不是私密连接」<b>还继续输密码</b>：密码可能被窃取","m":"https-ignore","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"登录页已改成 https://，但浏览器仍警告不安全，控制